            "provider": "chatgpt",
            "locale": "en",
            "hint": "Lexical verb: apply. Keep the distinction between a completed result or state and an ongoing process in the two clauses.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:11.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:11.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 11774,
